{'symbol': 'PFE', 'date': '2021-11-30 08:00:00', 'title': 'NIKANG THERAPEUTICS AND PFIZER ENTER CLINICAL TRIAL COLLABORATION AND SUPPLY AGREEMENT TO EVALUATE NOVEL COMBINATION THERAPIES FOR THE TREATMENT OF ADVANCED CLEAR CELL RENAL CELL CARCINOMA', 'text': 'WILMINGTON, DEL.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--NIKANG THERAPEUTICS INC. (“NIKANG”), A CLINICAL STAGE BIOTECH COMPANY FOCUSED ON DEVELOPING INNOVATIVE SMALL MOLECULE ONCOLOGY MEDICINES TO HELP PATIENTS WITH UNMET MEDICAL NEEDS, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS ENTERED INTO A CLINICAL TRIAL COLLABORATION AND SUPPLY AGREEMENT WITH PFIZER INC. (NYSE: PFE) TO EVALUATE NKT2152, A SMALL MOLECULE THAT INHIBITS HYPOXIA INDUCIBLE FACTOR 2Α (HIF2Α), IN COMBINATION WITH PALBOCICLIB, A CDK4/6 INHIBITOR, AND SASANLIMAB, A SU'}